Do not mark a FAT volume clean on an explicit filesystem flush error.
Guard only the clean transition (and its shutdown purge). Keep timer/DPC
cleanup, lower flush/shutdown notification and shutdown return policy.
On 4fbbefd614b, 6/10 -> 10/10 controlled volume and shutdown cases passed:
success, returned errors, mounted-dirty state and shutdown exceptions.
This does not change delayed cleaning, check lower hardware durability,
or repair an existing FAT mirror mismatch.

